class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p><br/>\nNorth of <a href=\"#/wiki/Zao\">Zao</a>, adventurers can find a small isle with the name Chazorai - Isle of Strife. As the name already suggests, competitions are a big topic on this isle. In the middle of Chazorai, on the top of the mountain, a huge arena is found in which the ranking among the dragons is determined in the annual great tournament. Each dragon sends a hero of its choice to fight in its name. This ensures that actually none of the dragons themselves is endangered. Many lizard statues and symbols on the island hint that the isle was already of importance during the lizard reign. Access to Chazorai is gained through <a href=\"#/quest/the-new-frontier-quest\">The New Frontier Quest</a>. With access to this island, you gain access to a few <a href=\"#/wiki/Draken%20Warmaster\">Draken Warmaster</a> spawns, most likely the first ones you will encounter. This is a good place to try soloing one.\n</p><p>See also the <a href=\"#/wiki/Svargrond%20Arena\">Svargrond Arena</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-NPCs\">NPCs</span></h2>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Chazorai NPCs (2 NPCs)</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center;\"></th><th style=\"width: 110px; text-align: center;\">Job</th><th style=\"width: 72px; text-align: center;\">Buy/Sell</th><th style=\"\">Location</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px;\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Chrak\">Chrak</a></td><td class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 64px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Chrak\"><img alt=\"Chrak\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Chrak_520bbb.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></t